From c1d3d6aa8d64ff50ccc7a439cdd3e2720abe4a9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 15:05:12 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] POC-15e: stat change, status and end-of-turn sounds from
 Emerald's animations

- Stat changes play SE_M_STAT_INCREASE / SE_M_STAT_DECREASE panned to the Pokemon
  (AnimTask_StatsChange, src/battle_anim_utility_funcs.c:562-564), after the move's sounds.
- New VEV_ANIM event: the rules post Emerald's status animations (inflicted, turn damage,
  asleep/frozen/paralyzed/confused/infatuated) and general ones (weather continues, Leech Seed,
  trap, Ingrain, Leftovers, Wish, Focus Band, Future Sight / Doom Desire hit); grid_draw plays
  their sounds from gPkbnStatusSounds / gPkbnGeneralSounds, one after another.
- Speed Boost posts its stat arrows (BattleScript_SpeedBoostActivates).
- Removed SE_BOO on status, SE_M_HYPER_BEAM on delayed hits and duplicate weather-move sounds.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
